guide forever/class/priest/priest-robes-horde
title Priest Robes at 5 (Horde)
category Class
class Priest
folder Priest
faction Horde
race Troll,Undead
levels 5-6
zone Durotar
keywords Garments of Spirituality, Garments of Darkness, In Favor of Spirituality, In Favor of Darkness, Juju Hex Robes, Acolyte's Sacrificial Robes, Grunt Kor'ja, Deathguard Kel, Lesser Heal, Power Word: Fortitude, robe, Priest
